# Styling Guidelines

## Color Palette
All colors should be taken from the root variables defined in [routes/global.styles.css](mdc:src/routes/global.styles.css). Do not use hardcoded colors or colors outside of this palette.

## CSS Structure
- Global styles are maintained in [routes/global.styles.css](mdc:src/routes/global.styles.css)
- Component-specific styles should use Svelte's scoped styling
- Use Tailwind utility classes where appropriate
- Custom CSS variables should be added to global.styles.css

## Best Practices
- Check global.styles.css before making design decisions
- Maintain consistent spacing using predefined variables
- Use semantic class names
- Follow mobile-first responsive design principles